    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24856_p32_b3",
      "text": "Allocation Zone (CAZ) framework (this paper), Geometric Evolution Maps (GEM) [Henry, 2026b],\nand CAZ Validation [Henry, 2026c]. It is a compact reference for a reader working from a single\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.16,
        158.16,
        541.55,
        182.6
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        284,
        632,
        2166,
